id: triclops
name: Triclops
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Earthling
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Thought by some to be the descendants of aliens, and by others to have innate talent which awakened an inner power in the human mind, these Earthlings have a third eye in the middle of their forehead, granting them vast and varied mystical powers.
